27:08.178 --> 27:15.120
[SPEAKER_01]: you know for example you have to make a collapse which is exactly in this angle of in this field on the paraglider you may have to mark the

27:15.500 --> 27:23.402
[SPEAKER_01]: paraglider with a 70 percent collapse for example when you make the collapse a collapse has to be exactly in this field you know sometimes

27:23.442 --> 27:33.857
